---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Dark Energy Cheat Sheet | Free Cosmological Constant, Acceleration"
  description="Complete dark energy cheat sheet with cosmological constant and acceleration. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Dark Energy<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Cosmological constant and acceleration. From discovery to fate of universe.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Discovery</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Type Ia Supernovae</h3>
        <pre><code>Standard candles: fixed luminosity
Phillips relation: brighter = slower
Distance indicators to z ~ 1
1998: two teams found accelerating expansion
Nobel Prize 2011 (Perlmutter, Riess, Schmidt)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Properties</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Equation of State</h3>
        <pre><code>w = P/ρ (pressure/density)
w = -1: cosmological constant (Λ)
w < -1: phantom energy (Big Rip)
w > -1: quintessence (Big Freeze)
Observation: w ≈ -1</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Energy Density</h3>
        <pre><code>ρ_Λ ≈ 5.96 × 10⁻²⁷ kg/m³
Ω_Λ = ρ_Λ/ρ_crit ≈ 0.68
ρ_crit = 3H₀²/(8πG) ≈ 9.47 × 10⁻²⁷ kg/m³</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Theoretical Models</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Cosmological Constant</h3>
        <pre><code>Λ: vacuum energy density
Einstein's "biggest blunder"
Problem: predicted vs observed ρ_Λ differs by 10¹²⁰
Cosmological constant problem: unsolved</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Quintessence</h3>
        <pre><code>Dynamic scalar field
w varies with time
Not constant like Λ
Can evolve: w(t) = w₀ + wₐ(1-a)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Fate of Universe</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Scenarios</h3>
        <pre><code>Big Freeze: dark energy dominates, expansion accelerates
Big Crunch: dark energy weakens, gravity wins
Big Rip: phantom energy tears apart structures
Big Bounce: cyclic model with dark energy</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
